WEBVTT

00:18.980 --> 00:22.680
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:22.950 --> 00:28.190
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.360 --> 00:33.890
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:34.060 --> 00:39.230
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.400 --> 00:44.670
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:44.970 --> 00:50.410
<i>Will you ever know how I feel?</i>
<i>Will you ever know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:56.050
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.220 --> 01:01.490
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:01.690 --> 01:09.390
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:23.750 --> 01:25.110
You wanna fight, asshole?

01:25.280 --> 01:26.810
Just bring it on.

01:26.980 --> 01:28.710
Frickin'-A!

01:29.620 --> 01:31.920
Sure, sounds like fun.

01:32.020 --> 01:34.820
We're really gonna
kick your asses, dammit!

01:38.830 --> 01:41.320
Tomorrow's the Cultural Festival, huh?

01:41.930 --> 01:45.560
I was gonna ask you,
what's your class going to do?

01:45.670 --> 01:47.640
A Host Club, they said.

01:47.740 --> 01:49.360
What? Hosts?

01:49.470 --> 01:52.460
"With your looks?" I know,
I've been dying to ask them that.

01:52.570 --> 01:54.440
So why didn't you stop them?

01:54.540 --> 01:57.980
Well, but you know those
guys can't ever get dates.

01:58.080 --> 02:00.670
And at least they seem
to be really into it.

02:00.780 --> 02:04.340
They see the Festival as their
chance to find a girlfriend. Or not.

02:04.450 --> 02:07.080
Let's just hope the
Festival ends on a safe note.

02:07.190 --> 02:09.380
I'm talking about the
seniors and the juniors.

02:09.490 --> 02:10.650
Oh, right...

02:11.130 --> 02:13.650
Why do they hate each other so much?

02:13.760 --> 02:16.890
Well, I do think the juniors
are justified, in a way.

02:17.000 --> 02:19.430
The seniors used to make
their lives miserable.

02:19.530 --> 02:20.630
What do you mean?

02:20.740 --> 02:23.900
You know Kudoh,
who used to be a senior here?

02:24.010 --> 02:26.170
Uh, right, the one who got expelled.

02:26.270 --> 02:28.440
Well, we had to call in the police...

02:28.540 --> 02:30.810
That kid was so out of control.

02:31.810 --> 02:35.840
But I'm sure it was a living hell
for the juniors before Kudoh left.

02:35.980 --> 02:39.850
He would beat them up
everyday for no reason.

02:39.950 --> 02:41.320
What a jerk!

02:41.420 --> 02:43.410
I can't stand those kinds of people!

02:43.520 --> 02:47.720
That said, after Kudoh was expelled,
the seniors pretty much fell apart...

02:47.860 --> 02:49.800
So that put a stop to
all the beatings, but...

02:49.900 --> 02:50.890
But what?

02:51.030 --> 02:53.760
The juniors aren't about
to forgive and forget.

02:53.870 --> 02:54.800
Right...

02:55.070 --> 02:56.730
But it's the perfect time for a truce!

02:56.840 --> 02:59.500
The juniors will get their
revenge, and that'll be it.

02:59.610 --> 03:04.270
That thug's coming back,
so who knows what'll happen?

03:04.380 --> 03:05.350
That thug?

03:05.450 --> 03:08.680
A senior out on suspension,
Ichiro Tsuruta.

03:08.780 --> 03:10.010
Tsuruta?

03:10.650 --> 03:15.610
<i>Schoolground Battle</i>
<i>Without Honor or Humanity!?</i>

03:17.530 --> 03:20.890
Kudoh's not around anymore,
so screw off, you loser senior!

03:21.000 --> 03:23.290
You wanna die,
you little piss-ant junior?

03:23.400 --> 03:24.560
Hey!

03:25.200 --> 03:26.430
Break it up!

03:26.530 --> 03:27.230
Oh, crap!

03:27.340 --> 03:28.630
I'll get you later, dickface!

03:28.770 --> 03:30.260
Hey, come back here!

03:30.370 --> 03:31.740
Run!

03:33.570 --> 03:35.300
He's a friend of Kudoh's.

03:35.440 --> 03:37.500
He's got strength like
you wouldn't believe...

03:37.780 --> 03:41.580
Even as a team, we could
just barely hold him down.

03:41.680 --> 03:42.740
Wow...

03:43.080 --> 03:43.810
Huh?

03:43.920 --> 03:46.580
But he's still suspended, so why...

03:46.820 --> 03:49.520
Because I gave him permission.

03:50.090 --> 03:51.560
You did, Vice Principal?

03:51.660 --> 03:56.360
Turns out that he's never taken
part in the Cultural Festival.

03:56.500 --> 03:58.330
Sure, because he was suspended.

03:58.430 --> 04:00.230
Oh, yes, I know that.

04:00.370 --> 04:03.240
That's why I thought he should
participate at least once.

04:03.340 --> 04:07.330
So I asked the Principal to give him
special permission to come to school.

04:07.410 --> 04:08.880
Is that a good idea?

04:09.080 --> 04:10.550
If he comes back here...

04:10.780 --> 04:14.580
Tsuruta himself expressed a
strong desire to participate.

04:14.680 --> 04:16.050
He took me by surprise.

04:16.150 --> 04:19.780
He even agreed to a
home visit for the first time.

04:20.250 --> 04:22.120
What? Did he really?

04:22.220 --> 04:28.530
Well, I'm counting on you all
to keep him out of trouble.

04:34.700 --> 04:36.140
What the hell?

04:36.240 --> 04:38.140
Thought they could corner us, huh?

04:38.240 --> 04:39.970
We're not fish, for chrissake!

04:40.780 --> 04:41.770
Dammit!

04:47.950 --> 04:50.320
Easy for him to say...

04:51.290 --> 04:52.150
Huh?

04:55.220 --> 04:56.210
What's this?

04:56.320 --> 04:57.350
Hey, Yankumi.

04:58.760 --> 05:00.290
Have you seen Minami?

05:00.400 --> 05:01.290
Shit!

05:02.060 --> 05:04.260
What the hell's he doing back here?

05:04.370 --> 05:05.800
Oh crap, we're screwed.

05:05.900 --> 05:07.960
Why? They'll just
go one-on-one.

05:08.200 --> 05:10.570
And he doesn't seem to be sashigoro...

05:10.670 --> 05:11.730
Sashigoro?

05:12.110 --> 05:14.340
He's got no blades, duh!

05:14.540 --> 05:16.670
Why would I know that?

05:16.780 --> 05:17.680
Anyway, look!

05:17.750 --> 05:19.980
Minami looks pretty psyched.

05:20.250 --> 05:23.810
Actually, I think he's
just scared shitless.

05:24.020 --> 05:26.320
He doesn't know
what the hell he's doing!

05:26.420 --> 05:29.720
Yeah, but the bigger guy
doesn't always win.

05:29.820 --> 05:30.790
Are you crazy?

05:30.890 --> 05:33.230
That's Tsuruta! He's a karate whiz!

05:33.860 --> 05:36.590
He's not just big,
he's freakin' invincible!

05:36.800 --> 05:39.060
He's gonna kill Minami...

05:39.530 --> 05:41.470
So that's where
you've been hiding!

05:41.570 --> 05:42.330
Huh?

05:42.900 --> 05:43.960
Hey, look!

05:44.070 --> 05:45.130
What's going on?

05:45.240 --> 05:46.330
What's happening?

05:46.470 --> 05:48.240
Hey, they gonna fight?

05:48.340 --> 05:49.940
Isn't that Tsuruta?

05:50.080 --> 05:50.940
You're right!

05:51.510 --> 05:53.850
The other one's that junior, Minami.

05:53.980 --> 05:56.950
So-so you're back, Tsuruta.

05:57.220 --> 06:00.590
I know you.
You're that junior, Minami.

06:00.690 --> 06:04.090
I thrashed you good and
you cried like a baby.

06:04.190 --> 06:05.520
Shut up!

06:05.630 --> 06:07.960
I won't let you jerk
us around anymore!

06:08.060 --> 06:08.960
Hear that?

06:09.060 --> 06:11.030
This is really painful...

06:13.940 --> 06:15.800
Did I feel something?

06:17.210 --> 06:19.570
But that was his best punch!

06:19.670 --> 06:21.040
What a wuss...

06:21.240 --> 06:23.070
You're a loser.

06:23.180 --> 06:25.870
You should just yield
to the stronger guys.

06:26.280 --> 06:27.480
Shut up!

06:28.350 --> 06:31.480
Can't back down with all
these people watching...

06:32.090 --> 06:33.880
Give me that bottle!

06:33.990 --> 06:34.550
What?

06:34.660 --> 06:35.990
Hurry up, Noda!

06:36.090 --> 06:37.060
O-okay!

06:39.930 --> 06:41.190
What's he gonna do?

06:41.300 --> 06:41.790
Beats me...

06:59.150 --> 07:00.910
Drunken Master?

07:01.120 --> 07:02.170
Noda!

07:02.320 --> 07:04.250
I swear, it's just oolong tea!

07:09.460 --> 07:10.930
Hah! An opening!

07:13.260 --> 07:14.850
Whaddya say?

07:15.800 --> 07:16.560
Huh?

07:17.400 --> 07:18.590
Hey, good one!

07:18.700 --> 07:19.890
You got him, you got him!

07:20.000 --> 07:20.930
You liar!

07:21.040 --> 07:21.700
Tsuru!

07:21.840 --> 07:22.830
Get him, man!

07:22.940 --> 07:25.530
Come on, beat the crap
out of those juniors!

07:25.640 --> 07:26.630
Huh? Hey...

07:27.240 --> 07:28.300
What's wrong?

07:28.410 --> 07:30.640
Why aren't you kicking their asses?

07:31.050 --> 07:32.100
That kid...

07:32.310 --> 07:33.580
He's piss-weak.

07:33.680 --> 07:34.650
What did you say?

07:34.820 --> 07:37.340
Well, yeah, sure he is!

07:37.490 --> 07:39.890
But if you don't kick his ass now,
he's gonna dis you for sure!

07:39.990 --> 07:40.650
That's right!

07:40.760 --> 07:43.380
He was totally talking
trash about you just now.

07:43.560 --> 07:44.390
What?

07:44.530 --> 07:47.020
I heard him say you had
an old man's face...

07:47.130 --> 07:48.860
...and you've got
eyebrows like seagulls!

07:48.960 --> 07:51.360
Who's he calling a seagull?

07:52.230 --> 07:54.460
Hey, I never said that!

07:54.740 --> 07:56.400
I swear, I never said that!

07:56.500 --> 08:00.100
He gets really pissed
if you trash his looks.

08:00.210 --> 08:02.140
Who would've thought...

08:04.580 --> 08:05.980
Minami, run for your life!

08:06.080 --> 08:08.050
No use! He's like a
rabbit in the headlights...

08:08.150 --> 08:11.120
What are we gonna do?
Shin's not gonna be in till the afternoon.

08:11.220 --> 08:12.240
Oh, crap!

08:12.550 --> 08:15.460
I can't go in and stop this...
too many people watching!

08:27.770 --> 08:28.960
Minami!

08:29.270 --> 08:31.500
Right at the last second...

08:32.940 --> 08:33.740
Tsuruta!

08:36.380 --> 08:38.640
He pulled that kick, huh?

08:38.910 --> 08:40.280
Minami! Are you all right?

08:40.380 --> 08:41.750
Don't die on us, Minami!

08:41.850 --> 08:42.870
Talk to us!

08:43.990 --> 08:44.540
So?

08:44.750 --> 08:46.350
What are you gonna do?

08:51.060 --> 08:53.720
You think you can work
this club looking like that?

08:53.830 --> 08:55.560
But it was the seniors...

08:55.660 --> 08:57.430
Men don't make excuses!

08:57.530 --> 08:58.590
Well, no sweat.

08:58.700 --> 09:02.140
Shin's our livelihood
and he's unscathed.

09:02.300 --> 09:03.360
That's right.

09:03.600 --> 09:05.440
That's not the point.

09:05.640 --> 09:08.870
Don't forget, you guys
have to help out too.

09:09.240 --> 09:11.370
I'm not going to do this host crap.

09:11.450 --> 09:13.040
Come on, give us a break!

09:13.150 --> 09:15.880
You're the one who's gonna
bring in all the money.

09:16.080 --> 09:19.350
We can make a killing
and score some women!

09:19.450 --> 09:21.120
Like it's really that easy.

09:21.660 --> 09:24.650
You really think we're
gonna pull off this club?

09:24.760 --> 09:26.920
Besides, I heard Tsuruta's back.

09:27.030 --> 09:30.400
Those seniors aren't just
going to let this go, you know.

09:30.530 --> 09:32.400
Well, if that happens...

09:32.830 --> 09:34.860
We'll just do what we can!

09:35.070 --> 09:36.060
Yeah, right!

09:36.170 --> 09:39.800
Either way, we're not gonna
let them give us any more shit!

09:39.910 --> 09:42.500
I'll flatten them with
my Drunken Master punch!

09:42.610 --> 09:44.880
Uh, yeah...

09:46.210 --> 09:48.910
Shin's right, I guess.

09:50.150 --> 09:52.380
They're gonna fight no matter what.

09:52.490 --> 09:54.350
Better not stop them
once they're at it...

09:54.490 --> 09:58.360
If they let off some steam,
that should end it.

09:59.130 --> 10:01.190
But who knows?

10:05.030 --> 10:08.990
<i>Cultural Festival</i>

10:09.140 --> 10:11.800
Hmm, a festival, eh?

10:12.740 --> 10:14.000
Well, then!

10:14.440 --> 10:17.470
I guess I should take a look around.

10:20.680 --> 10:22.810
Wow! There's a "Host Club"!

10:22.920 --> 10:25.080
They've even got photos!

10:25.190 --> 10:26.590
Any cute ones?

10:26.690 --> 10:28.880
Look at this redhead named Shin.

10:28.990 --> 10:31.080
Don't you think he's kinda hot?

10:33.730 --> 10:34.790
What the hell?

10:35.030 --> 10:36.660
Uh, nothing!

10:39.330 --> 10:42.500
Don't scowl like that,
you'll drive everyone away!

10:42.800 --> 10:45.100
So how's it going in there?

10:45.640 --> 10:47.070
Hmm...

10:49.680 --> 10:53.110
Look at your faces! You don't look
like guys in the nightlife trade!

10:53.210 --> 10:55.120
No wonder this place is empty!

10:55.220 --> 10:58.120
That's not gonna get
you girlfriends! Ever!

10:58.190 --> 11:01.380
What does the nightlife trade
have to do with girlfriends?

11:01.490 --> 11:03.420
Like you have the time
to worry about it?

11:03.520 --> 11:04.650
Okay, one more time!

11:05.490 --> 11:07.960
W-Welcome.

11:08.100 --> 11:08.620
Scary!

11:08.730 --> 11:09.530
Do it again.

11:10.930 --> 11:12.870
Welcome!

11:12.970 --> 11:14.130
Cuter, now!

11:14.270 --> 11:16.100
Welcome!

11:16.200 --> 11:17.760
Now say it gently.

11:17.870 --> 11:19.340
Welcome.

11:19.440 --> 11:21.410
Show me your wild side!

11:21.510 --> 11:22.370
Um...

11:22.510 --> 11:24.600
Welcome!

11:27.250 --> 11:28.650
Oh, damn!

11:28.750 --> 11:30.620
I knew this would be crap.

11:30.920 --> 11:34.050
Well, now! I thought you
had more balls than that!

11:34.160 --> 11:35.120
What'd you say?

11:35.220 --> 11:37.780
Don't tell me you're shy with girls?

11:37.890 --> 11:39.260
No frigging way!

11:39.630 --> 11:40.820
Oh yeah?

11:41.200 --> 11:43.960
To me it just looks like
you're trying to run away!

11:44.170 --> 11:45.830
Well, I'm not.

11:49.270 --> 11:53.640
All right, Shin, we need
you here to run the club.

11:53.740 --> 11:56.370
We're gonna snag some customers!

11:56.880 --> 11:58.210
See ya later, Shin!

11:58.310 --> 12:00.080
Let's go get 'em, now!

12:03.650 --> 12:05.090
A yakisoba shop?

12:05.190 --> 12:08.280
No way is it gonna be edible, anyhow.

12:08.760 --> 12:11.060
Let's just demolish the whole shop!

12:11.160 --> 12:11.960
Hey!

12:12.830 --> 12:14.230
Sorry we're late.

12:14.330 --> 12:18.100
Okay, all the reps from the
junior class are here now.

12:18.270 --> 12:19.320
Wait a sec.

12:19.700 --> 12:21.230
Where's Sawada?

12:21.340 --> 12:23.740
Shin's busy now with our Host Club.

12:23.840 --> 12:24.830
What?

12:25.070 --> 12:27.300
You guys aren't even
up to subbing for him.

12:27.410 --> 12:28.270
What did you say?

12:28.380 --> 12:29.340
Hey, calm down.

12:29.780 --> 12:32.180
So anyway, we were talking about...

12:32.280 --> 12:35.080
...how we don't stand a
chance with Tsuruta back.

12:35.180 --> 12:37.080
Well, I guess that's true.

12:37.180 --> 12:38.240
But here's an idea.

12:38.450 --> 12:40.980
Why don't we all jump Tsuruta first?

12:41.160 --> 12:44.020
I get it, overpower him, huh?

12:44.120 --> 12:46.720
Then you gotta let me
deliver the killing blow!

12:46.830 --> 12:47.800
Hold up, guys.

12:49.100 --> 12:50.860
No matter what the
circumstances are...

12:50.970 --> 12:52.960
I don't want to play a
dirty trick like that.

12:53.130 --> 12:55.030
Way to go, Kuma!

12:55.140 --> 12:57.230
Hey, I feel the same way, man.

12:57.340 --> 12:59.360
But what else can we do?

12:59.570 --> 13:01.100
Let's see...

13:02.010 --> 13:03.710
We could set a booby-trap!

13:03.810 --> 13:05.940
For chrissake! That's just as dirty!

13:06.050 --> 13:07.380
You're such a moron.

13:08.450 --> 13:09.540
Hey, Tsuru.

13:09.650 --> 13:12.120
Why aren't you meeting with the juniors?

13:12.250 --> 13:14.050
Come on, let's go kick their asses!

13:14.190 --> 13:15.820
I'm making yakisoba.

13:15.960 --> 13:16.920
Gotta sell it.

13:17.020 --> 13:18.720
No one's gonna come in here.

13:18.830 --> 13:20.890
Who gives a shit about that anyway?

13:21.000 --> 13:21.590
Hey!

13:22.260 --> 13:24.060
Those moron juniors sent this.

13:24.160 --> 13:25.330
What the hell?

13:25.430 --> 13:26.800
Are they screwing with us?

13:26.900 --> 13:27.990
Let's go, guys!

13:28.100 --> 13:29.470
Hey, pass it on!

13:29.640 --> 13:31.070
Let's put an end to this shit!

13:31.170 --> 13:32.660
Tsuru, move your ass!

13:46.650 --> 13:49.560
That smells pretty good, you know.

13:51.460 --> 13:53.020
Try some, will you?

13:53.160 --> 13:54.630
For me?

13:55.060 --> 13:58.090
Well, I can't very well
turn him down, can I?

14:03.440 --> 14:04.430
How is it?

14:04.710 --> 14:05.900
You like it?

14:07.070 --> 14:09.810
Mmm, this is damn fine yakisoba!

14:13.980 --> 14:15.070
Yeah?

14:15.180 --> 14:17.910
You're my first customer.

14:20.220 --> 14:21.650
I see...

14:22.260 --> 14:25.690
He's not quite like the
other seniors, is he?

14:38.570 --> 14:39.900
Well, now!

14:40.270 --> 14:42.870
Business isn't exactly bustling, is it?

14:42.980 --> 14:46.210
And I don't see many
juniors around, either.

14:46.310 --> 14:49.340
Oh, uh, they all went
to solicit customers.

14:49.450 --> 14:50.420
I see.

14:50.520 --> 14:54.250
It's good to know that this year's
Cultural Festival will end without incident.

14:54.360 --> 14:58.050
Well, at the moment, there doesn't
seem to be any trouble brewing.

14:58.160 --> 15:02.430
Still, I noticed that Tsuruta's
classroom was empty as well.

15:02.600 --> 15:05.290
They must've gone out to
hawk their product, too.

15:05.470 --> 15:07.700
Even my students went out to do that.

15:07.800 --> 15:08.790
Hmm...

15:08.900 --> 15:12.810
Then why don't we go out and
observe all this solicitation?

15:12.940 --> 15:16.170
It's a beautiful sight to see
students hard at work!

15:17.110 --> 15:18.600
A good idea.

15:18.710 --> 15:21.310
Yes, I'm sure we'll see
something interesting.

15:21.420 --> 15:23.880
Um, um, before you go...

15:24.050 --> 15:26.150
Um, let's see...

15:27.690 --> 15:30.660
Why don't you take a break at our club?

15:30.790 --> 15:33.760
Our Number One Host will
keep you entertained!

15:33.860 --> 15:35.660
Make yourselves at home!

15:35.760 --> 15:36.560
Hey, wait!

15:36.660 --> 15:37.760
What are you doing?

15:37.870 --> 15:38.700
Now, now, now...

15:38.800 --> 15:39.530
Now, then.

15:44.300 --> 15:45.640
What the hell?

15:45.740 --> 15:48.070
They call us out, and they don't show?

15:48.180 --> 15:50.370
This better not be a trick.

15:50.480 --> 15:52.470
If it is, they're all dead!

16:11.570 --> 16:13.260
What happened, Tsuru?

16:13.400 --> 16:16.340
Don't tell me this is a trap?

16:16.570 --> 16:17.500
Gotcha!

16:17.600 --> 16:19.510
Tsuruta's out of commission now!

16:19.610 --> 16:20.400
Come on!

16:20.510 --> 16:21.370
Let's go!

16:21.480 --> 16:22.470
You little shits!

16:22.580 --> 16:23.980
Goddammit! Kick their butts!

16:28.720 --> 16:30.080
Well, well.

16:30.180 --> 16:31.580
They're at it, all right.

16:31.720 --> 16:35.250
Guess they might as well
get it out of their systems.

16:37.620 --> 16:38.750
But still...

16:38.990 --> 16:42.430
I never thought they'd
actually dig that huge hole!

16:56.310 --> 17:01.270
<i>Yakisoba</i>

17:02.120 --> 17:03.810
Hey, Tsuruta.

17:05.490 --> 17:08.650
Here, I'll give you a hand.
Come up from there.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.410
No one's around.

17:11.960 --> 17:15.920
They were chasing each other around
and then they just scattered.

17:18.400 --> 17:19.300
So anyway...

17:19.430 --> 17:21.130
What are you going to do now?

17:21.270 --> 17:25.100
From what I saw,
today's fight ended in a draw.

17:25.240 --> 17:27.640
I'd say they got it all
out of their systems...

17:27.810 --> 17:29.640
...unless you keep acting like a heavy.

17:30.980 --> 17:32.410
Tell me the truth...

17:32.580 --> 17:35.740
You don't really want to
beat up the weak, do you?

17:36.750 --> 17:38.910
Yeah, but it can't be helped.

17:39.350 --> 17:41.520
It's the strong who rule!

17:42.160 --> 17:45.920
Whoever loses has no choice
but to suck up to the winners!

17:46.290 --> 17:48.060
That's why I have to do this!

17:48.360 --> 17:49.800
I hear you...

17:50.160 --> 17:53.690
But there are a lot of people
who are stronger than you.

17:53.800 --> 17:56.360
Does that mean that
you'll suck up if you lose?

17:56.470 --> 17:57.700
That's right.

17:57.800 --> 17:59.330
But there's nobody at school...

18:04.340 --> 18:08.300
I can take you out with
just these two fingers.

18:08.480 --> 18:09.110
What...

18:09.980 --> 18:11.110
What the hell?

18:11.220 --> 18:12.480
Who are you?

18:13.250 --> 18:15.280
Me? I'm a math teacher.

18:15.460 --> 18:20.050
And the only person in this
school stronger than you.

18:20.190 --> 18:21.360
Huh?

18:21.530 --> 18:23.520
You don't believe me, huh?

18:23.630 --> 18:24.890
Then come on!

18:25.000 --> 18:26.430
You'll see if you take me on.

18:26.530 --> 18:27.900
No way.

18:28.300 --> 18:30.270
I don't hit girls.

18:30.670 --> 18:31.400
No?

18:31.610 --> 18:33.730
Well, that shows you have a good heart.

18:33.840 --> 18:36.000
All right, then, how about this?

18:36.910 --> 18:39.510
You've got a big-ass face!

18:39.910 --> 18:40.970
Those eyebrows...

18:41.080 --> 18:44.980
Where does the right eyebrow end
and the left one begin?

18:45.720 --> 18:47.210
That's it, dammit!

18:47.320 --> 18:49.190
Goddamn you, that's it!

18:50.320 --> 18:52.520
You're gonna pay for that!

19:03.740 --> 19:05.760
Come on, that the best you can do?

19:05.940 --> 19:07.500
What did you say?

19:13.710 --> 19:15.680
N-No way...

19:15.950 --> 19:17.420
What a slowpoke.

19:17.550 --> 19:19.080
A fly could land on you!

19:20.890 --> 19:21.750
Over here!

19:28.330 --> 19:29.660
That's enough.

19:30.100 --> 19:31.570
You lose, kid.

19:31.670 --> 19:34.230
It's no good,
you'll never put a scratch on me.

19:41.170 --> 19:42.300
Now then...

19:42.780 --> 19:47.250
The loser has to do whatever
the winner says, right?

19:47.250 --> 19:48.040
First!

19:48.580 --> 19:52.540
You don't want to beat up on people,
so stop letting those guys egg you on.

19:52.650 --> 19:56.560
The truly strong never,
ever flaunt their power!

19:56.920 --> 19:57.860
But...

19:57.990 --> 20:00.550
You just flaunted yours, big time...

20:00.730 --> 20:01.750
Second!

20:01.960 --> 20:04.160
Don't talk back to me!

20:06.970 --> 20:08.660
And one last thing...

20:10.470 --> 20:12.100
Hit the books, huh?

20:19.080 --> 20:19.840
Listen...

20:19.950 --> 20:20.500
Huh?

20:21.010 --> 20:24.850
Has the Cultural Festival
ended already?

20:25.120 --> 20:27.140
No, I don't think so.

20:27.850 --> 20:30.260
You were running the
yakisoba shop, weren't you?

20:30.360 --> 20:31.850
Yeah.

20:32.060 --> 20:33.250
I know!

20:33.360 --> 20:35.350
Why don't you come and help us out?

20:35.460 --> 20:36.330
Huh?

20:36.500 --> 20:39.060
We've got all these
incompetent hosts, see...

20:46.110 --> 20:47.130
Ouch...

20:47.240 --> 20:47.970
Ow! Ow! Ow!

20:48.080 --> 20:52.070
Those moron seniors will know better
than to screw with us anymore, huh?

20:53.250 --> 20:55.510
Now we can focus on
finding girlfriends!

20:55.620 --> 20:57.640
Yeah, if any customers show up...

20:57.780 --> 20:58.680
Right...

20:58.920 --> 21:00.980
I guess finding girlfriends is...

21:05.290 --> 21:06.490
DOABLE!

21:06.960 --> 21:08.330
Welcome...

21:08.430 --> 21:09.090
What?

21:13.100 --> 21:15.470
Well, I must say I've
enjoyed myself here.

21:15.570 --> 21:17.770
The service has been impeccable!

21:18.210 --> 21:19.330
Uh, yes...

21:33.490 --> 21:35.350
What the...

21:35.520 --> 21:37.990
What the hell is Tsuruta doing here?

21:39.330 --> 21:40.320
Yankumi!

21:40.460 --> 21:41.660
Yankumi?

21:42.330 --> 21:44.890
Well, read it and weep!

21:45.630 --> 21:46.400
Huh?

21:46.500 --> 21:47.970
What was that?

21:48.140 --> 21:54.080
<i>TSURU-KUN, OUR NO. 1 HOST!</i>

22:06.590 --> 22:16.590
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:17.630 --> 22:27.560
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:28.340 --> 22:38.050
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:38.350 --> 22:43.260
<i>On those days when</i>
<i>I am alone and cold...</i>

22:43.490 --> 22:48.390
<i>...I'll light a fire</i>
<i>with my own two hands.</i>

22:48.830 --> 22:53.770
<i>The treacherous mountains</i>
<i>are my chosen path.</i>

22:53.930 --> 23:00.700
<i>I'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>without a backward glance.</i>

23:17.190 --> 23:19.180
Wh-what the hell?

23:19.360 --> 23:23.560
Ojou's school is being
targeted by a Maneki-neko?

23:23.700 --> 23:26.720
Now what in blue blazes can that mean?

23:26.870 --> 23:30.270
I mean, a Maneki-neko's job
is to "beckon" good luck.

23:30.370 --> 23:32.700
Normally you'd want to have one around.

23:32.810 --> 23:35.940
Well, I guess there are
some lowlife cats too, huh?

23:36.110 --> 23:38.510
Next episode:
School in the Crosshairs!

23:38.680 --> 23:40.170
Ojou, just watch...

23:40.280 --> 23:44.120
I'm gonna show that cat up...
BIG time!

23:45.050 --> 23:49.280
<i>To be continued...</i>
